# Codex Adapter

Read and follow the repository APG contract:

1. `/GOVERNANCE.md`
2. `/.governance/manifest.yaml`
3. applicable root-to-leaf `AGENTS.md`
4. authoritative project sources declared by the manifest and relevant to the task
5. applicable policies and optional extensions required by the task

Do not assume `PROJECT.md` exists unless the manifest declares it as a project source.

Do not duplicate canonical policy in this adapter.
